  "cism_stag_Dx_Dy": {
   "description": "Staggered x-of-y mixed second derivative with a cell-centered variable coefficient at the vertices: lowers D(k*D(psi,y),x) to the face-flux difference (k_E*D(psi,y)_E - k_W*D(psi,y)_W)/dx with the east/west face coefficients of cism_stag_Dx_Dx and the 4-point face-centered inner stencils D(psi,y)_E = (psi(i,j+1) + psi(i+1,j+1) - psi(i,j-1) - psi(i+1,j-1))/(4*dy) and D(psi,y)_W = (psi(i-1,j+1) + psi(i,j+1) - psi(i-1,j-1) - psi(i,j-1))/(4*dy). The DIVA x-momentum term D(2*etaH*D(v,y),x) applies it with psi = v and k = 2*etaH. For constant k the two face fluxes telescope to the standard centered stencil (psi(i+1,j+1) - psi(i+1,j-1) - psi(i-1,j+1) + psi(i-1,j-1))/(4*dx*dy) (probed at rel 1e-12). Interior vertices only. ESD PR candidate (see cism_stag_Dx_Dx).",
   "params": [
    "psi",
    "k"
   ],
   "priority": 10,
   "match": {
    "op": "D",
    "args": [
     {
      "op": "*",
      "args": [
