  "cism_stag_Dy_Dx": {
   "description": "Staggered y-of-x mixed second derivative with a cell-centered variable coefficient at the vertices: lowers D(k*D(psi,x),y) to the face-flux difference (k_N*D(psi,x)_N - k_S*D(psi,x)_S)/dy with the north/south face coefficients of cism_stag_Dy_Dy and the 4-point face-centered inner stencils D(psi,x)_N = (psi(i+1,j) + psi(i+1,j+1) - psi(i-1,j) - psi(i-1,j+1))/(4*dx) and D(psi,x)_S = (psi(i+1,j-1) + psi(i+1,j) - psi(i-1,j-1) - psi(i-1,j))/(4*dx). The DIVA x-momentum term D(etaH*D(v,x),y) applies it with psi = v and k = etaH. For constant k the two face fluxes telescope to the standard centered stencil (psi(i+1,j+1) - psi(i+1,j-1) - psi(i-1,j+1) + psi(i-1,j-1))/(4*dx*dy) (probed at rel 1e-12). Interior vertices only. ESD PR candidate (see cism_stag_Dx_Dx).",
